cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MyGlico: A Traceable Glycemic Monitoring Platform with Analytics, Provenance, and Semantic Export"
abstract: >-
  Academic MVP built around the MyGlico project. It ingests the public UCI
  Diabetes dataset into a relational core (patients and glucose records),
  computes glycemic indicators and anomaly/clustering analytics, records
  transactional provenance (PROV-JSON/PROV-TTL), exports an RDF semantic layer
  queryable via SPARQL, and exposes all of it through a FastAPI backend and a
  self-contained React (Vite) dashboard with pt-BR/en-US/es localization,
  including a translatable clinical PDF report per patient.
authors:
